                                                                Tautan Zoom Resmi Siap Digunakan
                                                            </span>
                                                            <button type="button" onclick="copyToClipboard('<%= req.zoom_link %>')" style="background: #eff6ff; color: #1d4ed8; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;">
                                                                📋 Salin Tautan
                                                            </button>
                                                        </div>

